<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Contact - Kekeli Ferme</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.7/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"
        integrity="sha384-LN+7fdVzj6u52u30Kp6M/trliBMCMKTyK833zpbD+pXdCLuTusPj697FH4R/5mcr" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/main.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('../partials/header.ejs') %>
    <main class="content-wrapper container py-5">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-lg-8">
                <div class="card p-4">
                    <h1 class="text-center mb-4">Contactez-nous</h1>
                    <p>Pour toute question ou commande, envoyez-nous un message via le formulaire ci-dessous ou
                        utilisez nos coordonnées.</p>

                    <% if (locals.successMessage) { %>
                        <div class="alert alert-success" role="alert">
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle me-2"></i><%= locals.successMessage %>
                        </div>
                    <% } %>

                    <form action="/send-message" method="POST">
                        <div class="row justify-content-center">
                            <div class="col-md-9">
                                <div class="mb-3">
                                    <label for="name" class="form-label">Nom :</label>
                                    <input type="text" class="form-control" id="name" name="name" required>
                                </div>
                                <div class="mb-3">
                                    <label for="email" class="form-label">Email :</label>
                                    <input type="email" class="form-control" id="email" name="email" required>
                                </div>
                                <div class="mb-3">
                                    <label for="message" class="form-label">Message :</label>
                                    <textarea class="form-control" id="message" name="message" rows="5"
                                        required></textarea>
                                </div>
                                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-success">
                                    <i class="fas fa-paper-plane me-2"></i>Envoyer
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </form>

                    <hr>

                    <div class="row text-center">
                        <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
                            <h5><i class="fas fa-envelope me-2"></i>Email</h5>
                            <p><a href="mailto:agribuscontact@gmail.com">agribuscontact@gmail.com</a></p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
                            <h5><i class="fas fa-phone me-2"></i>Téléphone</h5>
                            <p><a href="tel:+22890508668">+228 90 50 86 68</a></p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
                            <h5><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt me-2"></i>Adresse</h5>
                            <p>TDB</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
    <%- include('../partials/footer.ejs') %>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.7/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"
        crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
</body>

</html>
